## 🧰 Tech Stack

| Layer          | Technology |
|----------------|------------|
| **Frontend**   | Vite + vanilla JavaScript – see `src/` |
| **Backend**    | Firebase Cloud Functions (Node.js) |
| **Database**   | Cloud Firestore (NoSQL) |
| **Authentication** | Firebase Auth |
| **Hosting**    | Firebase Hosting (primary) / Docker |
| **Deployment** | GitHub Actions, Docker, Nginx |
| **Static Assets** | Vite build output in `dist/` |

---

## 📂 Project Structure

```
.
├── .github/workflows      # CI/CD pipelines
├── functions/             # Firebase Cloud Functions (backend)
├── public/                # Static assets (images, fonts, etc.)
├── src/                   # Frontend source code
│   ├── api/               # Streaming client
│   ├── modules/           # Session, payment, modal modules
│   ├── ui/                # Composer, messages, sidebar, settings
│   ├── utils/
│   └── app.js             # Chat core
├── evals/                 # Evaluation cases
├── docs/                  # Documentation & audit notes
├── .env.example           # Environment variables template
├── firebase.json          # Firebase Hosting/Functions config
├── firestore.rules        # Firestore security rules
├── firestore.indexes.json
├── package.json
└── vite.config.js
```

